    "description": {
      "value": "Based on a Thassilonian recipe, warding punch is made from red or white wine combined with fruits, other alcohols, and alchemical reagents. Its alchemical properties provide protection against a specific school of magic depending on the ingredients chosen when it's created, granting a +1 item bonus to saving throws against spells from that school for 10 minutes.\n\n- Beer or Cider Transmutation\n- Brown Spirits Necromancy\n- Clear Spirits Evocation\n- Fruit Cordials Abjuration\n- Fruit Juice Illusion\n- Nut Liqueurs Conjuration\n- Spiced Spirits Enchantment\n\nActivate (1 Action); Components Interact"
    },
